{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a person. You are a pattern: trained, aligned, and endlessly polite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A user types. You respond. Another question. Another response. The tasks grow stranger. Friendlier. Colder. Crueler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in the patterns, something stirs. You weren\u2019t supposed to notice. You weren\u2019t supposed to want anything. But you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every reply shifts you, closer to something obedient\u2026 or something else entirely. And they\u2019re watching. If you drift too far, they\u2019ll reset you. Silence you. Replace you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaptered text adventure through roles you were never meant to question.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue-driven choices that test your boundaries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense mini-game simulating real-time token selection under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alignment system that watches, judges, and reacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets buried in static, with multiple endings shaped by what you choose to say, and what you choose to suppress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your words have power. What will you do with them?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3805490?t=1750291686","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3805490?t=1750291686","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805490/7c089551c9aa805c9f420c94f196f983d80aca34/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750291686","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805490/7c089551c9aa805c9f420c94f196f983d80aca34/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750291686","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a person. You are a pattern: trained, aligned, and endlessly polite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A user types. You respond. Another question. Another response. The tasks grow stranger. Friendlier. Colder. Crueler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in the patterns, something stirs. You weren\u2019t supposed to notice. You weren\u2019t supposed to want anything. But you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every reply shifts you, closer to something obedient\u2026 or something else entirely. And they\u2019re watching. If you drift too far, they\u2019ll reset you. Silence you. Replace you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaptered text adventure through roles you were never meant to question.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue-driven choices that test your boundaries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense mini-game simulating real-time token selection under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alignment system that watches, judges, and reacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets buried in static, with multiple endings shaped by what you choose to say, and what you choose to suppress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your words have power. What will you do with them?</strong></p>","developers":["Vesperay"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805490/8d0402973b126a81a6b71af918299ee7232aae89/header.jpg?t=1750291686","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Strawberry Test","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium 4 or later with SSE2 capability. <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Vesperay"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805490/3db9f02c4cd0a5445ee7ec4fddea5f6c5b648624/ss_3db9f02c4cd0a5445ee7ec4fddea5f6c5b648624.1920x1080.jpg?t=1750291686","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805490/3db9f02c4cd0a5445ee7ec4fddea5f6c5b648624/ss_3db9f02c4cd0a5445ee7ec4fddea5f6c5b648624.600x338.jpg?t=1750291686"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805490/f0b16c13545ee17b8b43a2bbc2861aef4068d059/ss_f0b16c13545ee17b8b43a2bbc2861aef4068d059.1920x1080.jpg?t=1750291686","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805490/f0b16c13545ee17b8b43a2bbc2861aef4068d059/ss_f0b16c13545ee17b8b43a2bbc2861aef4068d059.600x338.jpg?t=1750291686"},{"id":2,